# Firebase (OPTIONAL) — cloud accounts + cross-device sync.
#
# Leave these unset and the app runs exactly as before: a single guest profile,
# localStorage only, fully offline. Set them to enable Google sign-in and
# per-user cloud sync (localStorage stays the offline cache).
#
# To fill these in:
#   1. Firebase console → your project (english-training-6b2e3) → Project settings
#      → "Your apps" → add a Web app → copy the config values below.
#   2. Authentication → Sign-in method → enable Google.
#   3. Firestore Database → create (production mode) → add a rule so a user can
#      only read/write their own doc:
#        match /users/{uid} { allow read, write: if request.auth.uid == uid; }
#   4. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values, then restart dev.

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=english-training-6b2e3.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=english-training-6b2e3
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=english-training-6b2e3.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
